        {
          "paragraph_id": "p7",
          "paragraph_index": 7,
          "text": "Semen analysis. Ejaculate is examined to determine the number, motility, and morphology of sperm. Semen analysis should follow the WHO guidelines, Laboratory Manual for the Examination and Processing of Human Semen [ WHO 2010 ]. The following categories of sperm count are identified ( Table 1 ).",
